#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Describes how long a Qiskit Runtime job can run, regardless of what "
"execution mode is used."
msgstr ""
"Menerangkan berapa lama kerja Qiskit Runtime boleh berjalan, tanpa mengira "
"mod pelaksanaan yang digunakan."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum execution time for Qiskit Runtime workloads"
msgstr "Masa pelaksanaan maksimum untuk beban kerja Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ensure fairness, there is a [service-calculated](#max-QPU) maximum amount"
" of time each Qiskit Runtime job can run. If a job exceeds this time limit, "
"it is forcibly canceled and a `RuntimeJobMaxTimeoutError` exception is "
"raised. You can also [set a maximum execution time](#max-job) on your jobs "
"to help control costs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memastikan keadilan, terdapat [masa maksimum yang dikira oleh "
"perkhidmatan](#max-QPU) untuk setiap kerja Qiskit Runtime boleh berjalan. "
"Jika sebuah kerja melebihi had masa ini, ia akan dibatalkan secara paksa dan"
" pengecualian `RuntimeJobMaxTimeoutError` akan dilemparkan. Anda juga boleh "
"[menetapkan masa pelaksanaan maksimum](#max-job) pada kerja anda untuk "
"membantu mengawal kos.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   The session or batch is immediately terminated when the cost limit is reached. Any jobs currently running in that session or batch will run to completion, but any pending jobs will be canceled.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
" <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   Sesi atau kelompok ditamatkan serta-merta apabila had kos dicapai. Sebarang kerja yang sedang berjalan dalam sesi atau kelompok itu akan terus berjalan sehingga selesai, tetapi sebarang kerja yang tertunda akan dibatalkan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"max-job\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"max-job\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set a maximum execution time {#set-a-maximum-execution-time}"
msgstr "Tetapkan masa pelaksanaan maksimum {#set-a-maximum-execution-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The maximum execution time for a job is the smaller of these values:\n"
msgstr ""
"Masa pelaksanaan maksimum untuk sebuah kerja ialah nilai yang lebih kecil "
"daripada:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The value set for `max_execution_time`\n"
msgstr "Nilai yang ditetapkan untuk `max_execution_time`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The service-determined job timeout value\n"
msgstr "Nilai tamat masa kerja yang ditentukan oleh perkhidmatan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `max_execution_time` value is based on *QPU usage*, not wall clock "
"time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nilai `max_execution_time` adalah berdasarkan *penggunaan QPU*, bukan masa "
"jam dinding.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the maximum execution time (in seconds) on the job options, as shown in "
"the following example.  See the [Estimator options](/guides/estimator-"
"options), [Sampler options](/guides/sampler-options), or [Executor "
"options](/guides/executor-options) guides for information about setting "
"options.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan masa pelaksanaan maksimum (dalam saat) pada pilihan kerja, seperti "
"yang ditunjukkan dalam contoh berikut. Lihat panduan [Pilihan "
"Estimator](/guides/estimator-options), [Pilihan Sampler](/guides/sampler-"
"options), atau [Pilihan Executor](/guides/executor-options) untuk maklumat "
"tentang menetapkan pilihan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also find how much usage completed jobs have consumed by returning "
"the job metrics as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda juga boleh mengetahui berapa banyak penggunaan yang telah digunakan "
"oleh kerja yang telah selesai dengan mengembalikan metrik kerja seperti "
"berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"max-QPU\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"max-QPU\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Service-calculated maximum execution time {#service-calculated-maximum-"
"execution-time}"
msgstr ""
"Masa pelaksanaan maksimum yang dikira oleh perkhidmatan {#service-"
"calculated-maximum-execution-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The service calculates an appropriate job timeout value based on the input "
"circuits and options. This service-calculated timeout is capped at 3 hours "
"to ensure fair device usage. If a `max_execution_time` is also specified for"
" the job, the lesser of the two values is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perkhidmatan mengira nilai tamat masa kerja yang sesuai berdasarkan Circuit "
"input dan pilihan. Tamat masa yang dikira oleh perkhidmatan ini dihadkan "
"pada 3 jam untuk memastikan penggunaan peranti yang adil. Jika "
"`max_execution_time` juga dinyatakan untuk kerja, nilai yang lebih kecil "
"daripada kedua-dua nilai digunakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, if you specify `max_execution_time=5000` (approximately 83 "
"minutes), but the service determines it should not take more than 5 minutes "
"(300 seconds) to execute the job, then the job is canceled after 5 "
"minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh, jika anda menyatakan `max_execution_time=5000` (kira-kira 83"
" minit), tetapi perkhidmatan menentukan ia tidak sepatutnya mengambil masa "
"lebih daripada 5 minit (300 saat) untuk melaksanakan kerja, maka kerja itu "
"dibatalkan selepas 5 minit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"batch-max-time\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"batch-max-time\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Batch maximum execution time {#batch-maximum-execution-time}"
msgstr "Masa pelaksanaan maksimum kelompok {#batch-maximum-execution-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When a batch is started, it is assigned a maximum time to live (maximum TTL)"
" value. After this TTL is reached, the batch is terminated, any jobs that "
"are already running continue running, and any queued jobs that remain in the"
" batch are put into a failed state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila kelompok dimulakan, ia diberikan nilai masa hidup maksimum (TTL "
"maksimum). Selepas TTL ini dicapai, kelompok ditamatkan, kerja yang sedang "
"berjalan terus berjalan, dan sebarang kerja dalam barisan yang masih dalam "
"kelompok diletakkan dalam keadaan gagal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Batches also have an interactive time to live (interactive TTL) value "
"between jobs that cannot be configured. If you don't explicitly close a "
"batch, it is deactivated after the interactive TTL expires and can be "
"reactivated at any time until it reaches its  maximum TTL.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kelompok juga mempunyai nilai masa hidup interaktif (TTL interaktif) antara "
"kerja yang tidak boleh dikonfigurasi. Jika anda tidak menutup kelompok "
"secara eksplisit, ia akan dinyahaktifkan selepas TTL interaktif tamat dan "
"boleh diaktifkan semula pada bila-bila masa sehingga ia mencapai TTL "
"maksimumnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For instructions to work with these values, see [Run jobs in a "
"batch](/guides/run-jobs-batch).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk arahan bekerja dengan nilai-nilai ini, lihat [Jalankan kerja dalam "
"kelompok](/guides/run-jobs-batch).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"session-max-time\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"session-max-time\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Session maximum execution time {#session-maximum-execution-time}"
msgstr "Masa pelaksanaan maksimum Session {#session-maximum-execution-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When a session is started, it is assigned a maximum TTL value that "
"determines how long a session can run. After this TTL is reached, the "
"session is terminated, any jobs that are already running continue running, "
"and any queued jobs that remain in the session are put into a failed "
"state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila Session dimulakan, ia diberikan nilai TTL maksimum yang menentukan "
"berapa lama sesi boleh berjalan. Selepas TTL ini dicapai, Session "
"ditamatkan, kerja yang sedang berjalan terus berjalan, dan sebarang kerja "
"dalam barisan yang masih dalam Session diletakkan dalam keadaan gagal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is also an interactive TTL value that cannot be configured.  If no "
"session jobs are queued within that window, the session is temporarily "
"deactivated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terdapat juga nilai TTL interaktif yang tidak boleh dikonfigurasi. Jika "
"tiada kerja Session dimasukkan ke dalam barisan dalam tempoh itu, Session "
"dinyahaktifkan sementara.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For instructions to work with these values, see [Run jobs in a "
"session](/guides/run-jobs-session).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk arahan bekerja dengan nilai-nilai ini, lihat [Jalankan kerja dalam "
"Session](/guides/run-jobs-session).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Other limitations {#other-limitations}"
msgstr "Batasan lain {#other-limitations}"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Inputs to jobs cannot exceed 50MB in size.\n"
msgstr "Input kepada kerja tidak boleh melebihi 50MB dalam saiz.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On the Open Plan, you can use up to 10 minutes on a QPU per 28-day rolling "
"window. You can view an instance's usage on the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada Pelan Terbuka, anda boleh menggunakan sehingga 10 minit pada QPU per "
"tetingkap bergolek 28 hari. Anda boleh melihat penggunaan instans di halaman"
" [Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

